                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e9c31bd6-9cea-40a8-be5a-0e22db9b1885",
                        "source_entry_id": "d8f8f254-4cf1-325c-a764-20d1b0874db4",
                        "source_sense_id": "7fb69bd4-c389-38d5-bd99-0b0be0326743",
                        "target_lang_word": "materialise",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "materialise",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37c15b43-d707-3327-b246-8e31c25f98e6",
                                        "entry_id": "0c59b9c2-f932-35b3-9419-54ca7566f5dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Non-Oxford British English standard spelling of materialize."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "nonstandard"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "807e4d34-c032-4cb1-a130-e2dd9db9fa1c",
                                                "sense_id": "37c15b43-d707-3327-b246-8e31c25f98e6",
                                                "text": "Therefore, the new standard design in fact has materialised as a 4-6-2 with two 20 in. cylinders and a boiler pressure of 250 lb. per sq. in."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29282658-495b-433b-8806-ee7efd806b5a",
                                                "sense_id": "37c15b43-d707-3327-b246-8e31c25f98e6",
                                                "text": "Third, while there is no immediate risk of Greece being kicked out of the club, such a threat could materialise if German taxpayers were to cut up rough and exert real political pressure on Angela Merkel's government."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6de4e7da-56d6-4397-a895-9bda894e9604",
                                                "sense_id": "37c15b43-d707-3327-b246-8e31c25f98e6",
                                                "text": "In the old Irish folklore, this is a land where no one gets old or sick and where heroes live in comfort and tranquillity. But the land of Tír na nÓg only materialises to mere mortals at certain times, under certain circumstances."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9bcb0e3-78d8-46f9-b617-8da4cd6e7d35",
                                                "sense_id": "37c15b43-d707-3327-b246-8e31c25f98e6",
                                                "text": "J H Thomas, the union's general secretary, argued in a letter to union reps on September 23 [1919] that \"the long-made promise of a better world for railwaymen which was made at the time of the nation's crisis, and accepted by the railwaymen as an offer that would ultimately bear fruit, has not materialised\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59825aee-05f5-4c47-8a35-ac9eaec81ddd",
                                                "sense_id": "37c15b43-d707-3327-b246-8e31c25f98e6",
                                                "text": "Camara was the Paok equivalent of Bruno Fernandes: a playmaker adept at materialising in pockets and running his team."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "912509b0-515d-4250-94cf-68dc3c42e90e",
                        "source_entry_id": "d8f8f254-4cf1-325c-a764-20d1b0874db4",
                        "source_sense_id": "7fb69bd4-c389-38d5-bd99-0b0be0326743",
                        "target_lang_word": "implement",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "implement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c81d74e5-942e-3b05-a823-d64a11169b64",
                                        "entry_id": "1380b5b2-8ab4-39df-80a9-8741e32d7bd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bring about; to put into practice; to carry out."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "464121bf-aa68-4dd6-8106-75f42eca792e",
                                                "sense_id": "c81d74e5-942e-3b05-a823-d64a11169b64",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: realize, actualize, materialize; embody; accomplish"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1c7762f-ac0a-4c56-b353-8f5bc5f55f7e",
                                                "sense_id": "c81d74e5-942e-3b05-a823-d64a11169b64",
                                                "text": "It’s a good thought, but it will be a difficult thing to implement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2ad7ef6-efcc-43a7-a668-88d94f6047ea",
                                                "sense_id": "c81d74e5-942e-3b05-a823-d64a11169b64",
                                                "text": "A considerable amount of beet comes from the Clonakilty and Courtmacsherry growing areas to Mallow and if the closure proposals mentioned are implemented this traffic will in future years be thrown on roads ill-suited to such heavy haulage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cf7b2c1-5ab0-4d70-a4b5-f12400721be3",
                                                "sense_id": "c81d74e5-942e-3b05-a823-d64a11169b64",
                                                "text": "Guardiola, who last won the Champions League in 2011, started with no defensive midfielder and no recognised striker and watched his midfielder-heavy lineup struggle to implement a complicated gameplan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "937dfafe-c055-313a-9c52-8d758fe8df64",
                                        "entry_id": "1380b5b2-8ab4-39df-80a9-8741e32d7bd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bring about; to put into practice; to carry out.",
                                            "To realize a technical specification, e.g. of an algorithm, interface, or protocol."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "implement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "455339c2-74f2-3d39-9168-b477b30a0e97",
                                        "entry_id": "720d4ca0-87fb-3b40-a41d-e09e7a9594bb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tool or instrument for working with."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1d44d01-090e-4a19-97ee-de55f4c55ec9",
                                                "sense_id": "455339c2-74f2-3d39-9168-b477b30a0e97",
                                                "text": "farming implements"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa7ca7d9-951a-4169-9e0e-5a9ec30aafb3",
                                                "sense_id": "455339c2-74f2-3d39-9168-b477b30a0e97",
                                                "text": "agricultural implements"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3342dad-75da-4dae-9e5a-a918e925a3bd",
                                                "sense_id": "455339c2-74f2-3d39-9168-b477b30a0e97",
                                                "text": "They carried an assortment of gardening implements in the truck."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e00e6c44-aaed-44a7-8c05-cf8427a12a43",
                                                "sense_id": "455339c2-74f2-3d39-9168-b477b30a0e97",
                                                "text": "A man dreamt as follows: He saw two boys struggling—barrel-maker’s boys, to judge by the implements lying around."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6cb3c5ca-dc9c-42cc-9f06-ab41a1396558",
                        "source_entry_id": "d8f8f254-4cf1-325c-a764-20d1b0874db4",
                        "source_sense_id": "7fb69bd4-c389-38d5-bd99-0b0be0326743",
                        "target_lang_word": "come true",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "come true",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7813d714-a341-3687-96c7-eb5026ce969b",
                                        "entry_id": "8c8d5ee8-f629-3e15-8742-54216470d07a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become real: to become true or existent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df30a50f-ce56-4f30-9e8d-f52f5d392cb5",
                                                "sense_id": "7813d714-a341-3687-96c7-eb5026ce969b",
                                                "text": "If you wish really hard, it just might come true."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d297bd0-094c-4d91-8959-ec83b2f39cf3",
                                                "sense_id": "7813d714-a341-3687-96c7-eb5026ce969b",
                                                "text": "Many of their predictions came true, but of course, many did not."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad06a755-5d7f-4b2a-8116-3d1eda1a92af",
                                                "sense_id": "7813d714-a341-3687-96c7-eb5026ce969b",
                                                "text": "So happy Christmas / I love you baby / I can see a better time / When all our dreams come true"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da93db64-307a-3a11-abdb-f2fc071edc2d",
                                        "entry_id": "8c8d5ee8-f629-3e15-8742-54216470d07a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To breed true; to maintain identity of salient characteristics through propagation processes."
                                        ],
